      <ul class="feature-section__list">
        <li><strong>A register of every AI tool in use.</strong> Auditable. Continuously updated.</li>
        <li><strong>Ownership mapped to real people,</strong> not just technical metadata.</li>
        <li><strong>The gap between approved tools and what's actually running.</strong> That delta, clearly.</li>
        <li><strong>Offboarding coverage</strong> that doesn't rely on people remembering to clean up.</li>
        <li><strong>A signal you can take into a board conversation</strong> without translating it.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
