      <p class="feature-section__eyebrow">Headline capability</p>
      <h2 class="feature-section__title">Ownership resolution is the hardest problem in identity governance.</h2>
      <p class="feature-section__body">Every tool can show you the account. Almost none can tell you who in the business owns it, whether it's still needed, or who to call when you need to shut it down. Aurora maps every discovered identity — especially service accounts — to a business owner. Not a technical owner. The person who can answer the question.</p>
